{"availability":"available","full":"Shraman123/KathaStudio","name":"KathaStudio","description":"Story → culturally adapted → voiced audio drama. Adaptation, not translation, with Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS designed voices, a resumable render pipeline, and a Gradio studio.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T12:22:17Z","updated":"2026-09-26T18:05:51Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://katha-studio-self.vercel.app","topics":["audio-drama","bengali","gemini","gradio","localization","python","text-to-speech"],"demo":"https://katha-studio-self.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.590Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.590Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.590Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.590Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Story → culturally adapted → voiced audio drama.","Katha Studio takes a long-form English story and gives it to a new audience the way a good editor would: through adaptation, not translation. Names, places, food, festivals, idioms and social texture change so the story feels native. The plot beats, the emotional arc and the ending stay exactly the same. The adapted story then becomes a multi-character audio-drama script and is performed by Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS, with a designed voice for every character.","The default target is a Bengali-speaking audience in West Bengal. Spoken output can be Indian English, Hindi or Bengali."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Shraman123/KathaStudio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cc4110c8c683f05c2d5fc72faeb13ae90cc1c48b8ddce463746885597dad575f","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.710Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.710Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Story → culturally adapted → voiced audio drama.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Shraman123/KathaStudio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[